  "instance_name": "absurdity_through_gendered_role_reversal",
  "label": "Absurdity Through Gendered Role Reversal",
  "description": "The meme uses the absurdity of an appliance (dishwasher) performing a human task (chopping vegetables) to highlight and mock gendered expectations. The humor is derived from the incongruity of a machine mimicking a traditionally female activity, which is presented as 'weird' — a term that implies the appliance is behaving in a way that is 'unusual' or 'wrong' because it mimics a gendered role. This relies on the audience understanding the social norms around gendered labor.",
